'''Chroma Evergreen''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2023|2023 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has the same design as the normal [[Evergreen]] weapon. The only difference is the color-alternating tinsel and color-alternating lights, instead of yellow.

== Trivia ==
*It is the chroma counterpart of the godly knife under the name [[Evergreen]], which was found in the same box.
*It pairs with the godly gun [[Chroma Evergun]] to make the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Evergreen Set|Chroma Evergreen Set]].
*On February 1st 2024 this item, along with [[Evergreen]] was duped, causing them to lose a lot of value.
*This and it's regular counterpart were the main targets in [[The Evergreen Glitch (2024)|The Evergreen Glitch (2024)]].
*Chroma Evergreen and Chroma Evergun has colors shimmering on the garland even when "/chromatoggle" is on.
*As of the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]]  this along with [[Evergreen]], [[Evergun]] and [[Chroma Evergun]] received the [[FX Weapons|FX]] tag.
*Before the release of the [[Christmas Event 2023|Christmas 2023]] event, this, along with [[Chroma Evergun]], were simply titled as "Chroma Tree".

